le='display:inline-block;width:9px;height:9px;border-radius:2px;background:#2ca02c;margin-right:6px'></span>DoublyRobust-O-W</td><td>0.763</td><td>&middot;</td><td>&middot;</td><td style='font-weight:700'>0.809</td><td>&middot;</td><td style='font-weight:700'>0.811</td><td style='font-weight:700'>0.811</td></tr><tr><td><span style='display:inline-block;width:9px;height:9px;border-radius:2px;background:#444444;margin-right:6px'></span>Oracle (best-means policy, on test)</td><td>0.818</td><td>0.818</td><td>0.818</td><td>0.818</td><td>0.818</td><td>0.818</td><td>0.818</td></tr></table>
