><td>0.057&plusmn;0.100</td><td>-0.000&plusmn;0.000</td><td>-0.000&plusmn;0.000</td><td>-0.000&plusmn;0.000</td><td>-0.000&plusmn;0.000</td></tr><tr><td><span style='display:inline-block;width:9px;height:9px;border-radius:2px;background:#1f77b4;margin-right:6px'></span>IPW-O-W</td><td>0.455&plusmn;0.172</td><td>0.597&plusmn;0.145</td><td>0.681&plusmn;0.028</td><td>0.676&plusmn;0.035</td><td>0.658&plusmn;0.040</td><td>0.658&plusmn;0.023</td><td>0.661&plusmn;0.037</td></tr><tr><td><span style='display:inline-block;width:9px;height:9px;border-radius:2px;background:#2ca02c;margin-right:6px'></span>DoublyRobust-O-W</td><td>0.596&plusmn;0.088</td><td>0.654&plusmn;0.070</td><td>0.688&plusmn;0.023</td><td>0.676&plusmn;0.035</td><td>0.680&plusmn;0.031</td><td>0.680&plusmn;0.030</td><td>0.679&plusmn;0.031</td></tr><tr><td><span style='display:inline-block;width:9px;height:9px;border-radius:2px;background:#444444;margin-right:6px'></span>Oracle</td><td>0.704</td><td>0.704</td><td>0.704</td><td>0.704</td><td>0.704</td><td>0.704</td><td>0.704</td></tr></table>
<p class='muted' style='margin:6px 0 0'>treat &le; 100%: realised E[Y] by Γ, N_train=700, mean &plusmn; SD over 5 seeds. XX flat (Γ-free); OX/OW sweep Γ. Past Γ≈8 the robust methods collapse.</p>
